#: NAVIGATION.md:1
msgid "Tutorial: Mastering Enhanced Sampling with OneOPES"
msgstr "Tutorial：OneOPES による Enhanced Sampling の習得"

#: NAVIGATION.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial was first given at the [Next-Generation Molecular Modeling "
"Summer School 2026](https://github.com/crs4/NGMM2026)."
msgstr ""
"[Next-Generation Molecular Modeling Summer School "
"2026](https://github.com/crs4/NGMM2026) で最初に行った Tutorial です。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:5
msgid ""
"It is a self-contained tutorial that guides the user in performing enhanced "
"sampling simulations, starting from the basics to dealing with suboptimal "
"collective variables and introducing replica exchange."
msgstr ""
"基礎から、最適でない CV や Replica Exchange まで、Enhanced Sampling を順に学べる自己完結した Tutorial "
"です。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:7
msgid ""
"Users are encouraged to read the main reference paper and to follow the "
"suggested accessory tutorials, from the basics of PLUMED syntax until the "
"OPES tutorial. These tasks are given as inputs in the flow chart below."
msgstr ""
"原著と、PLUMED 構文の基礎から OPES までの推奨 Tutorial を参照してください。下の Flow Chart に入力として示しています。"

#: NAVIGATION.md:9
msgid ""
"A number of OneOPES applications and a tutorial on OneOPES applied to host-"
"guest systems are refereed as outputs in the flow chart."
msgstr "OneOPES の応用と Host-Guest Tutorial を、Flow Chart の出力として示しています。"

